WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:04,390
Such big hail

2
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:06,070
Can the masses still live?

3
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:15,620
They will protect this child until their death

4
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,620
last life

5
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:18,460
This is how Zhuangyan saved me too

6
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,500
Wait for the opportunity

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,900
I will return your ashes to the country

8
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,300
I died in a natural disaster in my last life

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,300
this life

10
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,860
I will never give in again

11
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:36,680
Shen Wan, are you back?

12
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,800
I'm back, I'm fine

13
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,360
Thank God, I've been looking for you for a long time

14
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:40,680
The hail outside killed many people

15
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,000
I thought something happened to you

16
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,560
I'm not hurt, don't worry

17
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,280
By the way, the radio said there will be airdrops of supplies today.

18
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,480
I just don't know if it will be affected by the hail. Let's wait and see.

19
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,840
Although we don’t lack anything

20
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,480
But if you don’t go to receive the honor, it will easily arouse suspicion.

21
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,520
Also pay attention when you cook

22
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,440
Don't let the smell get out
